	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    Paragraph control dropdown is displayed outside when the browser width is small.&lt;br/&gt;
    To fix this problem, this PR uses `.dropdown-menu-right` bootstrap css class to make the dropdown right aligned with its parent so that it is always displayed inside of the paragraph.&lt;/li&gt;
